# Copilot instructions

This repository keeps its knowledge in files, not in chat. Before doing anything:

1. Read `AGENTS.md` (rules, commands, invariants).
2. Read `context/index.md` (task routing + catalog) and `memory.md` (current state, next step).
3. Load only the pages the task needs — each has a `## TL;DR`. Do not scan the repo to rediscover what the wiki already says.
4. Record as you work: `context/progress-tracker.md`, `context/decisions.md`, `memory.md`. Update the context pages covering any code you change.

Single source of truth is AGENTS.md — do not duplicate its rules here.
